# Google Docs API Key for Content Auditor (Public Google Docs)
# Create a Google Cloud API Key with Google Docs API enabled.
# Optional: without it the auditor falls back to Google's public export
# (works only for docs shared as "Anyone with the link can view").
GOOGLE_API_KEY=""

# Server port (default: 2000)
# PORT=2000

# Server bind address (default: 127.0.0.1)
# HOST=127.0.0.1
